WEBVTT

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.196
Hivyo nilipata yangu 
kwa njia yoyote ile.

00:02:30.196 --> 00:02:31.556
Nilipata yangu.

00:02:31.556 --> 00:02:33.680
Elimu ya fedha
kweli ilitawala dunia,

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.656
na nilikuwa mtoto mtumwa kwake

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.920
nikifuata mtu mbaya.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.456
Nikiwa na miaka 17, 
nilikamatwa kwa wizi na mauaji

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:47.456
na punde nikajifunza kuwa fedha jela 
zinatawala zaidi ya zilivyo mitaani,

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.680
Hivyo nilitaka kuingia.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.656
Siku moja, nilikurupuka kushika 
ukurasa wa michezo katika gazeti

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.496
ili mfungwa mwenzangu anisomee,

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.936
na kwa bahati mbaya 
nikachukua sehemu ya biashara.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.216
Na huyu mzee akasema,
"Hey, kijana, umechukua hisa?"